{"parse": {"title": "THH-16", "pageid": 64954, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/THH-15\" title=\"THH-15\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">THH-16</span><a href=\"/wiki/THH-17\" title=\"THH-17\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">THH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">16</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.8B.A6.E7.9B.AE.E7.B3.96\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"苦目糖\">苦目糖</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 苦目糖</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Picrasma Candy</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>至<span class=\"color-value\"></span>少<span class=\"color-value\"></span>能<span class=\"color-value\"></span>够<span class=\"color-value\"></span>取<span class=\"color-value\"></span>悦<span class=\"color-value\"></span>口<span class=\"color-value\"></span>舌<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2110116</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……就是这儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>就是这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前的走廊与他处别无二致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>看这些脚印……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这是在十分钟之内留下的脚印。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……可是我们没有看到707的房门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我能感受到这附近有一些能量的扰动……但这绝不是出于神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将掌心贴上了墙壁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>除了神秘术，还有什么能让这些能量如此的焦灼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>……噢，两位，请问有什么能够帮助您的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>毫无预兆地，侍应生的声音在身后响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……蓝手帕小姐，我有一个问题想问问你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雇佣兵紧紧地盯着侍应生，目光灼灼，如同猎人终于追寻到了猎物的血迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>你知道那个707房间该怎么走吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>707？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……是的——我想，我要找的东西也许就在那个房间里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>嗯……我乐于满足客人的要求，客房服务或是更换房间，只要是我能做到的，我一向不吝于帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>但您的要求过界了——那不是您该去的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……很可惜，看来我们的谈判破裂了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>瞬息之后，又见星光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的眼睛里再次燃烧起了蓝绿色的辉光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>……这样频繁地施展神秘术，对您的眼睛并不好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>您的长辈没有告诉过您吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侍应生的声音中不无担忧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>所以你什么都知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>哈，您这样大张旗鼓地动作，当然会让所有人都知道……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>这就是您的极限……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>三。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>二。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309717.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309717.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-309717.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309717.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>该死的，我知道，故弄玄虚向来是你的拿手好戏……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309715.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-309715.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309715.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309715.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-309715.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309715.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-309715.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309715.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雇佣兵眼中的辉光在一瞬间熄灭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的眼睛微微睁大，随后打破了四周如水般的沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309715.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-309715.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309715.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309715.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-309715.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309715.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-309715.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309715.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……灯怎么熄灭了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>走廊之中的灯光一如往常。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>……灯一直亮着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿尔古斯并未再说什么，她从口袋中摸出了苦目糖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的双手微微颤抖，以致于糖从她的手中滑落，“啪嗒”地掉在了地板上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拾起了糖块，放在了雇佣兵的掌心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>苦目糖不是万能的解药。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她吞下糖块，嚼碎，连同其上附着的灰尘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……一般来说，糖块总能很好地发挥它的效用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>吃一颗，通常能让完全丢失的视野恢复到50%——非常管用。但对于我的工作而言，50%的视野还远远不够用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>所以，这个时候需要再吃下一颗，让视野恢复到100%。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喉头滚动，口腔传来如预想般的甜蜜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这可以满足绝大部分的需求，但偶尔也会有些更棘手的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这个时候需要吃第三颗——需要注意的是，这已经是一个比较危险的数字了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她又往嘴里扔了一颗糖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>按照以往的经验，现在就差不多能够看到东西了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奇迹并没有发生，她的眼睛依旧沉寂，如同星光死尽的夜空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……是我吃得还不够多吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>当然——不是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>或者说，您正是因为吃得太多了，才会让眼睛在这样关键的时刻派不上用处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>一切事物都是如此，它们一旦超过合理的限度，反而会引发自身的毁灭——如何掌握这个限度，是值得所有人用一辈子去学习的学问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>就好像我也总得提防着，不要让那些孩子过于恐惧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侍应生似乎想起了一些美妙的回忆，雪白的面孔上略带餍足。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>哈……您一直坚定地相信它的作用是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>一颗糖，50%；两颗糖，100%；三颗糖，用于应付更危险的情况……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>多么值得信赖呀，这小小的糖果……就像所有人眼中的阿尔古斯，她是那样的伟大，所有的任务只要到了她的手上，保准能够被搞定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侍应生咯咯直笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>哈哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>正是因为您一直相信着它……才赢来了如此盛大的毁灭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>就像那些镇民的信任……反而使一个人走向了万劫不复的深渊。噢，真是可怜的家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>他们当然也不会想到……所谓的百眼巨人，竟然是一个盲目的瞎子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>你他*的又是谁？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她向着声音的来源狠狠地扣下了扳机，耳边的枪声振聋发聩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>墙壁上出现了深深的弹痕，整座旅馆发出了古怪的嚎叫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>该死的，该死的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>哈，没打中呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她极力地压抑着过于活跃的交感神经，颤抖的手指在自己的手背上掐下了一道道红痕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>……嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她轻巧地掂着步子，将心口抵在了枪管上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>这下好啦，一切都对得整整齐齐的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>只是您按得下扳机吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她微微侧首，嘴角含笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>这一切的决定权在您的手上……不过，我死了以后，您可就再也找不到707了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>数羊羔、凯拉……都在那个房间，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>——别用你那脏嘴叫她的名字！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>为什么呢？凯拉小姐是一个很好的住客，我很喜欢她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侍应生饶有兴味地看着雇佣兵的面孔，后者正因愤怒而变得扭曲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……够了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我想，我们需要好好谈谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>噢，小姐，没有这个必要了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>我的孩子很想见见您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……孩子？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的目光投向了侍应生怀中的襁褓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>嗯，事实上，它才是这个旅馆的主人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将襁褓塞入了维尔汀的怀中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>所以我想……您应当先和它打个招呼——抱住它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>襁褓的分量远比她想象的要轻——这并不是一个孩子的重量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她恍惚间看见脚下的地毯翻滚为泥沼，而蓝手帕立于泥沼之上，满含微笑地看着她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>维尔汀？维尔汀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的双耳仿佛浸入水中，雇佣兵的呼喊如同身处彼岸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>急切的脚步声自远处传来，而手中的那个襁褓沉重得如同铅坠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——有什么东西没过了脚踝，她一直在下沉，仿佛要自此坠入一个无明的世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>放开它，维尔汀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一枚青绿色的火焰挣扎着亮起，雇佣兵匍匐在地上，紧紧地拉住了她的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>该死的，我从来没有做过这么亏本的买卖——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>阿尔古斯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-309713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-309713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-309713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>——啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>属于侍应生的皮靴轻轻地碾住了雇佣兵的手指，后者发出了惨痛的叫声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-309814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-309814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-309814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>别做多余的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>——维尔汀小姐，无需担忧，这是必要的过程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-309810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-309810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-309810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>让我来看看你的梦。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "THH-16"}}